# Implementation Plan: UI/UX Enhancements for Electrical Engineering E-Learning

This plan describes the proposed UI and UX enhancements for the platform to make it feel like a professional, modern, and interactive technical instrument. The enhancements are derived from the instructions in [AGENTS-UI.agent](file:///c:/Semester/version%20Skripsi/v1/.agents/workflow/AGENTS-UI.agent) and [web-design-guidelines](file:///c:/Semester/version%20Skripsi/v1/.agents/skills/web-design-guidelines/SKILL.md).

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **Persistent Global Navbar:** We will introduce a shared, responsive top navbar across all authenticated pages (`/dashboard`, `/materi`, `/simulasi`, `/asesmen`, `/evaluasi`). This replaces the current scattered headers, providing a unified navigation experience.
> - **Trace Line Border Effect:** We will implement the custom border-drawing and underline animations representing PCB traces using CSS keyframes and transitions.
> - **Collapsible Subchapter Navigation Sidebar:** We will add a sidebar for lesson pages to let students switch between subchapters quickly, visualising status dots (not started, in progress, completed) mapped to their database progress.
> - **Instrument Readout Formatting:** We will standardize all voltage, current, resistance, and score values across all screens to use monospace typography (`font-mono` / JetBrains Mono) so they feel like technical instruments.

