## Proposed Changes

We will group our modifications into three logical layers: Styling Foundation, Navigation & Structure, and Typography/Aesthetics.

---

### 1. Styling Foundation

#### [MODIFY] [globals.css](file:///c:/Semester/version%20Skripsi/v1/src/app/globals.css)
- Update standard page backgrounds from `bg-black/95` to `--bg-base` (`#0E1A24`) or the custom `bg-bg-base` utility.
- Add `.bg-schematic-grid` background grid line helper representing a blueprints/circuit schematic sheet utilizing `--grid-line` (#25404D).
- Implement custom PCB trace-line animations:
  - Underline tracer for active Navbar tabs.
  - Border tracer for active/hovered cards (drawing itself around the card edges).
- Add accessibility focus styles: override default outline rings with custom trace-teal rings (`focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-trace-teal outline-none`).
- Implement the `prefers-reduced-motion` media queries to disable animations and transition-all in favor of simple opacity/color crossfades.

