## Verification Plan

### Automated Verification
- Run compilation checks (`npm run build` or `next lint`) to ensure TypeScript and linter compiler compliance.
- Confirm all modules and server action bindings function correctly.

### Manual Verification & QC Inspection
- **Aesthetic Wow Factor:** Ensure the deep circuit-board background (`#0E1A24`) paired with glowing teal trace borders gives the application a technical, high-quality instrument feel.
- **Responsive Layouts:** Test layout widths down to 360px on mobile simulation modes to verify layout wrap.
- **Keyboard Tab Order & Focus:** Tab through the entire Navbar and interactive sliders/buttons to ensure focus rings (`outline-trace-teal`) are clearly visible.
- **Accessibility Verification:** Turn on prefers-reduced-motion to confirm all transitions crossfade instantly without scrolling, border-draws, or glowing pulses.
